under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or (at your option)
any later version. See LICENSES/LGPL-2.1.txt.

Third-party code in this repository
-----------------------------------
launcher/third_party/: TweetNaCl, public domain.

Native DXVK
-----------
The native renderer (sce_module/dxvknative.prx) and its clients
(jkpro-files/d3d9.dll, jkpro-files/d3d9-pe.dll) ship in the package only.
Our changes to DXVK: Copyright (c) 2026 XxXJoker13XxX. Free to use, copy,
change and redistribute, if every release names the author with the line
"Native DXVK by XxXJoker13XxX". Full terms: LICENSES/JkFlow-Native-DXVK.txt.
The DXVK base stays zlib/libpng (LICENSES/DXVK-zlib.txt).

Not in this repository
----------------------
No game files and no Konami files. No Kitserver files: Kitserver 13 is the
player's own mod under its own licence, which allows redistribution of
unmodified binaries only. JKPro's optional face fix applies JKPro's own
bytes to the player's own fserv.dll on the console and keeps the original.

Name and badge
--------------
The JKPro name and icon are not covered by the code licence. Forks are
welcome under the LGPL, but must use their own name and must not present
themselves as official JKPro builds. The "Official Build" badge is shown only
for packages signed with the release key.

See THIRD_PARTY.md, LICENSES.md and CREDITS.md for everything the package
uses and who made it.
